
====================================================
🚀 Amazon Devices Builder Tools for AI
====================================================

This tool installs (updates) the context document and sets up the MCP config for your AI agent to get insights for Amazon Devices App development.
The MCP config enables usage of the amazon-devices-buildertools-mcp in your project
The context document guides AI agents to efficiently answer queries related to app development for Amazon Devices

Choose from the following options to automatically install an Agent specific preset in your app project:

1. Cursor
   Cursor AI IDE - Uses AGENTS.md file in project root

2. Claude Code
   Claude Code - Uses CLAUDE.md file in project root

3. GitHub Copilot
   GitHub Copilot CLI - Uses AGENTS.md file in project root

4. Kiro
   Kiro - Uses .kiro/steering folder

5. Cline
   Cline - Uses .clinerules folder

6. OpenCode
   OpenCode - Uses AGENTS.md file in project root

7. Codex
   OpenAI Codex - Uses AGENTS.md file in project root

8. Gemini CLI / Antigravity CLI
   Gemini CLI / Antigravity CLI - Uses GEMINI.md file

9. Other/Custom Agent
   Other AI agent or custom setup - View content only


